Description: Privacy-preserving statistics across sites that never share
             their data, using fully homomorphic encryption through the
             'openfhe.R' interface to OpenFHE (CKKS, BFV, BGV), with
             n-of-n threshold key generation so that no single party can
             decrypt. Ships master/worker primitives that let ordinary R
             modeling code run across sites, and a frozen implementation
             of the Paillier additive scheme kept for backward
             compatibility.
